      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The nastier Myth Monsters may only be figments of our imaginations, but they're still dangerous.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Constance_EM2_11.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1447332,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "There's a ghost story from the Athanor days called the Sphinx, sire of Meowl-kind, meant to punish us for abandoning the Chain of Ice and Fire.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Constance_EM2_12.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1447332,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It's never been seen, not really. But with the Chain broken, the old stories are spinning up again and a group of hunters decided to go find it.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Constance_EM2_13.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1447332,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I just figured they'd hunt Meowls until they got tired and came home. But if you're right, their own fear of the Sphinx could make it real.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Constance_EM2_14.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1447332,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So they may need your help. Fight Meowls until you find some trace of the missing hunters. Then bring them home.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Constance_EM2_15.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1447332,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
